### TVK Assistant chat

@baseUrl = http://192.168.1.16:5001
@apiUrl = {{baseUrl}}/api/v1
@accessToken = REPLACE_AFTER_LOGIN

### Assistant status
GET {{apiUrl}}/assistant/status
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### Chat (text)
POST {{apiUrl}}/assistant/chat
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=----TVKBoundary

------TVKBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="message"

How do I raise a complaint?
------TVKBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="locale"

en
------TVKBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="history"

[]
------TVKBoundary--
